    73	<sup>10</sup> Toolathlon-Verified sets no max_tokens limit for individual model requests.<br>
    74	<sup>11</sup> YC-bench retains only the most recent 10 turns of user dialogue as historical context before each model call.<br>
    75	<sup>12</sup> DeepPlanning, EnterpriseOps-Gym, Tau3-Bench are evaluated using their official repositories.<br>
    76	</small>
    77	
    78	Nanbeige4.3-33B leads on most of the benchmarks, showing strong performance in both agentic coding and cowork tasks. 
    79	Beyond its breadth across benchmarks, Nanbeige4.3-33B shows strong performance on **agent tasks across a wide range of professions and industries**. For example, on JobBench, it outperforms the baseline in most of the 35 occupations evaluated.
